[Instant Karma - Native Turbo]
author=Instant Karma v0.7.41
description=Hold R2 = 3x, hold L2 = 6x, R3/L3 toggle 3x/6x. Off while the menu is open. Music stays normal speed. 6x needs EE Cycle Rate 300%. Also automatically speeds up the Mantra acquisition screen's transitions.
